msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There’s a pool of liquid at my feet, rising just short of my ankles.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It’s sticky "
"and uncomfortably warm."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫발밑에 ⟪k:1⟫물이 고여 있었다. ⟪k:2⟫복사뼈까지 차오른 미지근한 감촉에 ⟪k:3⟫불쾌감이 일었다."

#: search2:search2_50CC9511_9901_4D85_8FB5_50BB66AE354A
