msgid "⟪k:0⟫Every step I take makes ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫splat, ⟪k:3⟫splat⟪k:4⟫ noises. ⟪k:5⟫This is—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫한 걸음을 내딛을 때마다, ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫뚝, ⟪k:3⟫뚝 소리가 났다.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫이건―――"

