#: search2:search2_B52EAB6A_CF13_4FC3_8BDF_A4DD04E6FFD6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 95c2a9c9ed84d40fb4ff2f4de2823e89a748f7e8e1a01d26f1711979a9b06979
