msgctxt "search2:search2_B52EAB6A_CF13_4FC3_8BDF_A4DD04E6FFD6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The mansion has taken on a very different face from when Giselle was leading me through its "
"halls."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫저택의 상태가―― ⟪k:1⟫지젤이 내 손을 잡고 이끌던 때하고 달라졌다. ⟪k:2⟫누구 것인지도 모를 피"
"는 ⟪k:3⟫발밑 뿐만 아니라――"

#: search2:search2_C56DA4F8_1A75_46EB_ADAA_B7EA8720943F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 868159fd521f67b162ae3998f5531f9538b174a8f1583f6d303d1a8aa638989f
