msgctxt "search2:search2_C0DC5FF1_0C16_4E74_9924_A253D589E779"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I’m speechless as I behold the dreadful scene.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Every breath I take tastes and "
"smells of rust."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫나는 시야를 온통 차지한 기이한 광경에 ⟪k:1⟫말문을 잃었다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫숨을 들이쉬니 ⟪k:4⟫그만큼 "
"⟪k:5⟫비릿한 피냄새가 났다."

#: search2:search2_EC7E50AC_94F3_4F4E_9CB3_398A34C3BBAD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fedf8dae49d3de366e3420cd87faade62554eafe97adf6d1f808715b75adea8a
