msgctxt "search2:search2_44E62CF9_E6C3_4C50_AEAB_30D5C2F230FB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫All I can do is stare, aghast—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫feeling like I might pass out."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그 악몽 같은 광경에 ⟪k:1⟫경악을 금치 못 하여 ⟪k:2⟫현기증이 일었다."

#: search2:search2_FDB3E01C_9C46_41F8_BD42_8A98C8B25356
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fc12041c687eff6de4041539907ed5a1ece99a937284afaa841a795854f9c880
#. default-sha256: 99f2b6fdf46bee3a835d5cb70ed81775a6f473a5238e1a8bc5486c173d78cc59
msgctxt "search2:search2_FDB3E01C_9C46_41F8_BD42_8A98C8B25356"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I promise... ⟪k:1⟫I will come for you...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫So please, just hang in there for a little "
"longer..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫반드시…… ⟪k:1⟫데리러 가겠습니다…….⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫그러니 ⟪k:4⟫부디―― 조금만 더…… ⟪k:5⟫기다려 주십시"
"오……."

#: search2:search2_ECDB402B_0466_40D9_A15B_7B6BE2D97675
